  dialogueBackground: {fileID: 360391067}
  dialogueLines:
  - Welcome to Aiman and Amin's World!
  - I am the father Bear. Let's observe these two together.
  - Aiman and Amin are twins. Same home, same love.
  - However, they don't experience the world the same way.
  - Let's head over there and see how they play.
  - As you can see, Aiman is not your usual encounter. He is "special".
